# =============================================================================
# GOBERNANZA DE ROLES DEL IDP (.github/CODEOWNERS)
# =============================================================================
# Este archivo protege el nucleo de la plataforma y las plantillas para que
# los desarrolladores de aplicaciones/modulos no puedan alterar el motor del IDP
# sin la aprobacion explicita del equipo de Platform Engineering.
#
# Configuracion recomendada en la GitHub Organization (ej. github.com/dsc-uni):
#   - @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers : Arquitectos y mantenedores del nucleo del IDP
#   - @dsc-uni/app-developers  : Desarrolladores y voluntarios de apps/modulos
# =============================================================================

# 1. Nucleo Protegido del IDP (Solo Mantenedores de Plataforma)
/README.md                      @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/GUIA_DESARROLLADOR_JUNIOR.md   @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/AGENTS.md                      @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/CLAUDE.md                      @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/CONVENTIONS.md                 @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/.cursorrules                   @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/.windsurfrules                 @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/opencode.json                  @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/package.json                   @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/pnpm-workspace.yaml            @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/turbo.json                     @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/tsconfig.json                  @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/packages/**                    @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/tooling/**                     @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/.ai/**                         @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/.opencode/**                   @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/.claude/**                     @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/.agent/**                      @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/.github/**                     @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/specs/**                       @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers

# 2. Zona de Extension Abierta a Desarrolladores de Apps y Modulos
/apps/**                        @dsc-uni/app-developers @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/modules/**                     @dsc-uni/app-developers @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
/specs/ACTIVE_SESSION.md        @dsc-uni/app-developers @dsc-uni/idp-maintainers
